  "id": "preventive-care",
  "term": "preventive care",
  "definition": "Preventive care is care aimed at reducing health-risk behaviours before they lead to chronic disease or worse outcomes. In mental health settings, it refers to support such as lifestyle or behaviour-change counselling to improve risks like diet, exercise, or smoking, with potential benefits for both physical and mental health.",
